# {{projectName}}

Scaffolded with [`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude) using the
`react-fastapi` stack.

## Layout

- `frontend/` — React + Vite + TypeScript app
- `backend/` — FastAPI service (Python {{pythonVersion}})

## Quick start

```bash
# Frontend
cd frontend
pnpm install
pnpm dev

# Backend (in another shell)
cd backend
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```
